abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for using AI agents to assist
  regression-test selection while deterministic change evidence, traceability,
  mandatory policy and release gates remain authoritative. The work covers
  change-impact analysis, risk-based selection, test criticality, historical
  quality intelligence, flaky-test governance, adaptive regression expansion,
  AI-system regression, observability, agent evaluation, CI/CD quality gates and
  production feedback into permanent regression evidence.
